Are you #enhancing the skill?  When you make 20 hits with a weapon
that you are unskilled in, you should get a message indicating you can
advance your skill.  #enhance will show you a menu, which should have
a letter beside the appropriate skill.  Press that letter to advance. 
Skills don't automatically advance because you have a limited number
of skill slots, and the game wants you to be able to decide how you
will spend them.

